23:## 1. Why this exists
52:## 2. Scope, and the hard guardrails that bind every leg
56:1. discovers every **tracked** dependency manifest and lockfile on `main`;
58:3. emits a **CycloneDX 1.6 JSON** SBOM including the **library↔library** dependency graph;
64:- **No leg applies a dependency bump. No manifest and no lockfile changes inside 0.8.20.** The
