  For AC-SBOM-10, this test trusts `sbom_survey.cyclonedx.validate()` from the implementation under test to prove schema validity, so an implementation that returns `None` unconditionally can pass while emitting invalid CycloneDX JSON. Since the criterion is specifically guarding against hand-rolled invalid SBOMs, the test should invoke an independent CycloneDX/json-schema validator directly or include a known-invalid negative check.

